Use docs/ideas/source-parity/warpdotdev-warp.json as the source decision ledger.
Keep command discovery inside the existing reachable CommandBar.
Register only fixed local Nexus routes; never execute query text.
Preserve deterministic ranking, keyboard access, preview, focus return, and accessibility.
Do not copy Warp code, UI, assets, styles, or product text.
Respect the current mixed AGPL-3.0/MIT upstream boundary.
